---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Donate" description="Support free English, French, and German lessons for Palestinian students with a donation to Ramzunā Languages.">
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="bg-primary-600 py-16 lg:py-24 dark:bg-primary-900">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Make a Donation</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-primary-100">
        Every donation helps keep language lessons free for Palestinian students, for as long as they need them.
      </p>
      <nav class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-primary-200" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-white">Donate</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Active Fundraiser -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-primary-700 dark:bg-primary-900/50 dark:text-primary-300">Active Fundraiser</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">Our Symbol of Hope</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          In Gaza, the infrastructure to support education has been severely damaged. Our students are ready to learn, but they face a scarcity economy where the cost of basic connectivity has risen by over 1,000%. Your donation funds the essentials that keep learning alive.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-3xl rounded-2xl bg-cream-100 p-8 shadow-soft dark:bg-gray-900">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">$50</span>
          <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">raised of $2,000 goal</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-700 dark:bg-primary-900/50 dark:text-primary-300">2% Funded</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-700 dark:bg-accent-900/30 dark:text-accent-300">Campaign Live Now</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 h-2.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-gray-800">
          <div class="h-full w-[2%] rounded-full bg-primary-600"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 italic text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Every donation goes directly toward keeping students powered, connected, and qualified — from device repairs and solar energy to the certification exams that open doors to scholarships and boost remote career opportunities.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Choose Your Impact -->
  <section class="bg-cream-100 py-20 lg:py-28 dark:bg-gray-900">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-primary-700 dark:bg-primary-900/50 dark:text-primary-300">Choose Your Impact</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">What will your donation do?</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Select the impact you want to make. You will complete your donation securely on WhyDonate.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-4xl gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2" data-donate-cards>
        <button type="button" onclick="rfSelect(this)" class="group rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 text-left shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft-lg dark:bg-gray-800">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent-100 px-3 py-1 text-lg font-bold text-accent-700 dark:bg-accent-900/30 dark:text-accent-300">$25</span>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">The Connectivity Share</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Funds essential charging port and cable repairs, keeping a student's device alive for their weekly lessons.</p>
        </button>

        <button type="button" onclick="rfSelect(this)" class="group rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 text-left shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft-lg dark:bg-gray-800">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent-100 px-3 py-1 text-lg font-bold text-accent-700 dark:bg-accent-900/30 dark:text-accent-300">$50</span>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">The Screen Rescue Fund</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Contributes toward screen repairs ($135–$375 due to part scarcity). Just 3–5 donors restore one device from blacked-out to fully functional.</p>
        </button>

        <button type="button" onclick="rfSelect(this)" class="group rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 text-left shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft-lg dark:bg-gray-800">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent-100 px-3 py-1 text-lg font-bold text-accent-700 dark:bg-accent-900/30 dark:text-accent-300">$100</span>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">The Solar Study Unit</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Procures high-efficiency solar capacity at $5/watt — the daily energy a student needs to attend lessons without a power grid.</p>
        </button>

        <button type="button" onclick="rfSelect(this)" class="group rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 text-left shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft-lg dark:bg-gray-800">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent-100 px-3 py-1 text-lg font-bold text-accent-700 dark:bg-accent-900/30 dark:text-accent-300">$250</span>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">The Power Storage Guardian</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Funds a share of a high-capacity battery system ($2,600+ locally) so a student can study at night — often the only quiet time available for learning.</p>
        </button>

        <button type="button" onclick="rfSelect(this)" class="group rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 text-left shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft-lg dark:bg-gray-800 sm:col-span-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent-100 px-3 py-1 text-lg font-bold text-accent-700 dark:bg-accent-900/30 dark:text-accent-300">$300</span>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Break the Barrier</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Covers one full language certification exam (IELTS / TOEFL / DALF).</p>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 text-center">
        <a href="https://whydonate.com/fundraising/ramzuna-our-symbol-of-hope-in-every-lesson" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-accent-500 px-8 py-4 text-base font-medium text-white shadow-lg shadow-accent-500/30 transition-all hover:bg-accent-600 hover:shadow-xl">
          Donate Now on WhyDonate
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Secure payment &bull; You will receive a receipt</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script is:inline>
      function rfSelect(el) {
        document.querySelectorAll('[data-donate-cards] button').forEach(function (c) {
          c.classList.remove('ring-2', 'ring-primary-600');
        });
        el.classList.add('ring-2', 'ring-primary-600');
      }
    </script>
  </section>

  <!-- How Your Donation Is Used -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-primary-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-primary-700 dark:bg-primary-900/50 dark:text-primary-300">Transparency</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">How your donation is used</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Every dollar is tracked and reported. Here is exactly where your money goes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-lg font-bold text-white">01</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">You Donate</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">You contribute securely through WhyDonate and receive an immediate email receipt.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-lg font-bold text-white">02</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Devices &amp; Connectivity</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Funds cover device repairs and charging equipment, distributed directly to students in Gaza.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-lg font-bold text-white">03</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Energy &amp; Exams</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Remaining funds purchase solar equipment and cover certification exam fees.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-3xl rounded-xl bg-primary-50 p-6 text-gray-700 dark:bg-primary-900/20 dark:text-gray-300">
        <strong class="text-primary-700 dark:text-primary-300">Transparency commitment:</strong> A small percentage (typically 2–3%) covers payment processing fees. All remaining funds are directed exactly as described above. We publish updates on our WhyDonate page so you can track every dollar.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-primary-600 py-16 lg:py-24 dark:bg-primary-900">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-4xl">Other Ways to Help</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-primary-100">
        Not able to give right now? You can still support our mission by exploring our programmes or partnering with us.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a href="/services" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white px-8 py-3 font-medium text-primary-600 shadow-lg transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100">
          Our Programmes
        </a>
        <a href="/partners" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border-2 border-white/30 px-8 py-3 font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white/10">
          Partner With Us
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
